    "created_at": "2016-10-18T13:15:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T13:15:34Z",
    "body": "I know @tabatkins added the ability to use `data-lt=\"\"` to ensure Bikeshed and friends never ever try to pick up the dfn. But I would prefer if Bikeshed didn't try to use magic to infer on HTML, since at this point it's going to be mostly false positives. Is there a way to do that?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
