    "created_at": "2016-10-18T23:23:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T23:23:58Z",
    "body": "That'd be @plinss's responsibility, as he's the one that maintains the spider with its magic.  Bikeshed does some type inference within Bikeshedded specs, but not from the database.  (And whatever magic is inferring the \"value\" type here is not the same magic I use in Bikeshed anyway.)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
