    "created_at": "2016-10-19T16:27:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T16:27:25Z",
    "body": "The heuristics apply everywhere, not just legacy specs, and the parser doesn't discriminate between legacy or not. Besides, removing the heuristics from the HTML spec would break far more dfns than it would fix (like all the elements and attributes, which don't specify their dfn type).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
