    "created_at": "2016-10-19T16:28:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T16:28:39Z",
    "body": "This is just really frustrating. I was told that `<dfn>`s were noexport by default, but this is apparently not true. I think we at the very least need to update the Bikeshed documentation to point that out.\n",
