    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T16:38:20Z",
    "body": "Untyped &lt;dfn>s are noexport by default, but the docs do describe auto-detection of dfn types in https://tabatkins.github.io/bikeshed/#dfn-types. I agree it could be a bit more clear that auto-export applies to auto-detected types.\n",
