    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T17:09:06Z",
    "body": "Bikeshed's doc says:\n\n> Most definitions are automatically \"exported\", which means they’re made available for other specs to autolink to. The only exception is \"dfn\" type definitions, which aren’t exported by default.\n\nwhich is both correct, and a little bit too subtle, as you might just misread it as `<dfn>` type definitions, while seems to mean `<dfn dfn-type=dfn>`.\n",
